# The walls are metallic; a guided mode must not feel them.
# Reference: the same grid solved with a sparse eigen-solver in SciPy. The index must stay within 5e-5 of the standard window.
title Silicon strip 450 x 220 nm in a 5 um wide window
grid dx=0.025 dy=0.02
window width=5 ymin=-1.8 ymax=2.02
rect si -0.225 0.225 0 0.22
symmetry even
field te
expect neff 2.416580397 2e-8
expect guided yes
expect cells 19100
expect neff 2.4165803 5e-5
